# Stage artifact Markdown

- Start with a `#` title that includes the story key when known.
- Use clear `##` sections matching the stage’s required outline.
- Prefer tables for findings, acceptance criteria, and traceability.
- Mark inferences vs story facts explicitly.
- Link sibling artifacts with relative paths when referencing prior stages.
- Keep secrets out of artifact bodies.
